msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:60 aaff4669f6124bc89d6e9b75a09a27b2
msgid "对 DRO，保持频率可以很低。文献基准（Zhang & Wang 2022，2:1 DRO ~72000 km）："
