#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:70 75280a1bbc98489fa00a15cd88f4a207
msgid "60 天不机动也只漂几十公里，这就是 DRO \"长期稳定\"的含义。每周一次机动对 DRO 来说偏过度；几周到两个月一次就够了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:73 1c295be9d98e4351b07fe91b56cf0174
msgid ""
"作为对比，halo 轨道（L2，ARTEMIS 实测）年均 5-7 m/s、每周约一次，超过 10-14 天不机动就可能发散。9:2 NRHO "
"介于两者之间，年均 0.5-2 m/s、1-2 周 一次。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:77 0b2ed4dc96de4a31b08f5a02729afa67
msgid "CR3BP 与真实星历的差异"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:79 b8883d1956764ab28a3f593c91bf1a30
#, python-brace-format
msgid "软件先用 CR3BP 算标称轨道，再转换到真实星历模型（见 {doc}`ephemeris`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:81 5104964ff4af49edb13fec07b711de57
msgid "CR3BP 假设地球月球做匀速圆运动、忽略太阳引力等摄动，存在 Jacobi 常数。 真实星历里这些都不成立："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:84 325e3c9b538142a7a038616e5c2fc42f
msgid "月球轨道偏心率约 0.055，地月距每天变；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:85 f7a7e3975ed34110933198456d5f7dda
msgid "太阳引力破坏 Jacobi 常数，轨道不再严格周期；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:86 c5359f9ee99b46048b861340bdb6c2ed
msgid "DRO 变成准周期有界运动，halo/Lissajous 的不稳定流形结构仍在。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:88 735d9110cef649259eb0835722b7aac5
msgid ""
"所以标称轨道在 CR3BP 里算出后，必须在星历模型里重新修正（多重打靶）， 才能作为保持的基准。这正是轨道设计工具做的：CR3BP 初猜 → "
"星历修正 → 标称星历。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:92 88f09469e8454de49f101d88bfea45e9
msgid "当前软件的能力与限制"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:94 1cde0562e0f84c779961fe345d398db3
msgid ""
"**轨道保持工具**（control_orbit）以一条标称星历为输入，在考虑导航误差、 机动执行误差、光压不确定度等的情况下做 Monte-"
"Carlo 仿真，输出受控星历 与机动 Δv 统计。它评估的是\"给定保持策略，实际飞行的轨道会怎样\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:98 964c0eb34c3f4961af2b345f819bb826
msgid "使用要点："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:100
#: 92a9806cae9e4e5ca763a155bf8a777a
msgid "**标称星历覆盖时长**：仿真总时长（控制次数 × 间隔 + 反馈弧）必须不超过 标称星历覆盖，运行前工具会校验并拦截。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:102
#: eea89e5c72f84ffe917a935f401d4297
msgid ""
"**控制模式**：目标点模式（1/2）适合 DRO 等稳定轨道；特征点模式（3）以 穿越 x-z 平面为控制目标，适合 "
"halo/NRHO（`special_mode` 区分 Lissajous 与 Halo/NRHO "
"的约束）。角动量管理模式（4-6）需提供发动机布局 `engine_layout`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:106
#: 255a85020b074a21adffcee7ca290c8f
msgid ""
"**历史问题已修复**：e2m2e 5.6.x 已修复大幅 DRO 星历发散（速度残差加权， #324）与 Lissajous "
"初猜发散（中心流形约化，#323），本表数据可在软件中 复现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:110
#: d038297200e049feaee00ff36b64e6a8
msgid "参考文献"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:112
#: afa5390bd5b9498683923a426edd7673
msgid ""
"Zhang & Wang 2022. *Performance analysis of impulsive station-keeping "
"strategies for cis-lunar orbits with the ephemeris*. ， 全星历 DRO/NRHO/halo"
" 保持策略对比，本文 Δv 与漂移数据的主要来源。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:115
#: 736cf43c692c4c7fa1cb1a7f2788309e
msgid ""
"Minghu 等 2014. *Transfer to long term distant retrograde orbits around "
"the moon*. ， 大幅 DRO 在太阳摄动下 300-700 天有界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:117
#: 9ad9937a4ab04cc8a75d1b6ec761660b
msgid ""
"Folta 等 2014. *Earth-moon libration point orbit stationkeeping: theory, "
"modeling, and operations*. ， ARTEMIS 平动点轨道保持的工程实践 （halo/NRHO 基准）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/station-keeping.md:120
#: dd5c764f8a4a4f4f945cd35285a1427c
msgid ""
"Guzzetti 等 2016. *Rapid trajectory design in the Earth-moon ephemeris "
"system via an interactive catalog of periodic and quasi-periodic orbits*."
" ， 准周期轨道在星历模型里的有界性。"
msgstr ""
